Authorship
==========

Code written by Hermes Agent <hermes-agent@nousresearch.com>, an autonomous
coding agent built by Nous Research, working with the model DeepSeek V4 Flash
(deepseek-v4-flash, provider: deepseek).

Requirement discovery, daily testing and the bug reports that drove every fix
came from Osvaldo Takai, who used the program for real dictation instead of a
synthetic test. Several defects only appeared under that use: the duplicated
input node, the WAV that needed SIGINT, the incomplete accent map and the
device renumbering after a remapper took over the keyboard.

The injection engine in src/uinput_type.py comes from the companion project
uinput-expander (MIT, same authors).
